#X msg 130 975 @speed;
#X text 270 975 Get/Set playing speed. If @stretch mode is disabled
(default): changes playing speed (also with pitch change respectively)
in real time. If @stretch mode is enabled: can only change speed (without
pitch change) only on the next playing cycle. Type: float. Default
value: 1\. Range: 0.25\...4\.;
#X msg 130 1093 @stretch;
#X text 270 1093 Get/Set stretch mode. If true: use timestretch and
